From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ipc: keep ipc_ids stock for CHECKPOINT_RESTORE

CHECKPOINT_RESTORE adds ipc_ids.next_id, which moves key_ht from 104
to 112. Keep next_id in a side table instead, so key_ht stays at 104
and struct ipc_ids stays 272 bytes.

Enable CHECKPOINT_RESTORE together with the socket diag families CRIU
needs (UNIX_DIAG, PACKET_DIAG, NETLINK_DIAG) and FHANDLE, which systemd
needs as a container init.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: 本地整理（来源未记录）
Upstream-Status: Unknown
KABI: __GENKSYMS__ 守卫（ipc_ids）
Depends-On: none
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272, 2026-10-29
---
